    "description": {
     "value": "<p>[[/attack extended]]. [[/damage extended]].</p><p>The target must succeed on a [[/save]] saving throw or take [[/damage average activity=dnd5eactivity100]] damage and become &amp;Reference[poisoned] for 1 minute. The target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p>",
     "chat": "<p>The Quasit attacks with its Claw. The target must make a <strong>Constitution</strong> saving throw. The target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p>"
